## Entry for the Table of Contents
An ionization strategy has been developed to fabricate a porous MOF liquid, which shows large adsorption of $\mathsf{C O}_{2}$ . The adsorbed $\mathsf{C O}_{2}$ can subsequently be slowly released and efficiently utilized to synthesize for example, cyclic carbonates.
